# Needs the dev test stock (TST). Trades 10 TST and places orders but advances no days (nothing
# fills); cleanup cancels them, sells back and restores the player's monitor settings.
name with open buy and sell orders, the Stock Monitor list, detail and Your Portfolio cards keep every text inside its box
# the game's own Investments lists, whatever the "Investments list and research" flag says
investments-list off
monitor remember
set-price TST 100
show-buy TST
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 10
click Button
wait 1
show-buy TST
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-Limit
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 5
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 95
click Button
show-sell TST
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-TakeProfitSell
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 10
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 125
click Button
expect-orders-delta 2
monitor close
monitor open
wait 1
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorOrders-TST 2 orders
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulStockMonitor
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRow-TST
wait 1
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorDetailStat-4-0 BUY ≤ ₡95 · SELL ≥ ₡125 (target)
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulStockMonitor
capture monitor-detail-two-orders
show-sell TST
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-StopLossSell
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 10
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 80
click Button
expect-orders-delta 3
wait 1
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorDetailStat-4-0 3 open (see Your Portfolio)
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulStockMonitor
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorBack
wait 1
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSettings
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorOpt-Compact
wait 1
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulStockMonitor
capture monitor-row-orders-compact
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorOpt-Compact
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSettings
show-economy
wait 1
scroll-into-view FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderRow-$order
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderRow-$order
cleanup:
investments-list restore
cancel-new-orders
sell-back TST 10
set-price TST 100
close-dialog
monitor close
monitor restore
close-economy
